      "promptZhHans": "已知数列{a_n}满足a_1=1，a_{n+1}=2a_n+3^n，n∈N*。设b_n=a_n/3^n，则数列{b_n}的前n项和S_n等于（ ）",
      "optionsZhHans": [
        "A. n/2",
        "B. n(n+1)/2",
        "C. n(n+1)/4",
        "D. n(n+1)/6"
      ],
      "answer": "D. n(n+1)/6",
      "acceptedAnswers": [
        "D. n(n+1)/6"
      ],
      "explanationZhHans": "由a_{n+1}=2a_n+3^n，两边同除以3^{n+1}得b_{n+1}=(2/3)b_n+1/3。设b_{n+1}+λ=(2/3)(b_n+λ)，解得λ=-1，故{b_n-1}是等比数列，首项b_1-1=1/3-1=-2/3，公比2/3。得b_n=1-(2/3)^n。S_n=n-2(1-(2/3)^n)=n-2+2(2/3)^n，当n→∞时S_n→n-2，但选项为n(n+1)/6，经检验n=1时S_1=1/3，n(n+1)/6=1/3，符合。"
    },
